<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-badin-hydractinia-stolon-vascular-net-code-traceability> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Buss, Anderson & Perry (2015) Biol. Bull., Dudgeon et al. (1999) Am. Nat. & Blackstone (1999) Syst. Biol. colonial hydroid pulsatile gastrovascular stolon network, anastomosis loop closure, and runner-to-sheet morphospace — Code-to-model traceability: 93/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Module and function docstrings map every governing equation to Buss, Anderson & Perry (2015) Biol. Bull., Dudgeon et al. (1999) Am. Nat. Eqs. 1-6, Blackstone (1999) Syst. Biol., Buss (2001) Evol. Dev., and the 3 formal Lean 4 theorems in `morphoeval/lean/loops/Loop_100_hydractinia_stolon_vascular_net.lean` (L1-56, L196-497)." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-code-traceability> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/code-traceability" ;
    pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-badin-hydractinia-stolon-vascular-net-code-traceability-1> ;
    pk:hasScore 9.3e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-badin-hydractinia-stolon-vascular-net-model-fidelity> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Buss, Anderson & Perry (2015) Biol. Bull., Dudgeon et al. (1999) Am. Nat. & Blackstone (1999) Syst. Biol. colonial hydroid pulsatile gastrovascular stolon network, anastomosis loop closure, and runner-to-sheet morphospace — Model fidelity to source: 95/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Implements the planar colonial hydroid stolon graph and weighted Laplacian Kirchhoff solver (`solve_gastrovascular_kirchhoff`, L196-254), coupled pulsatile polyp oscillator + shear-gated lumen adaptation and anastomosis/regression solver (`simulate_colonial_hydroid_morphogenesis`, L262-415), 5-regime morphospace evaluator (`evaluate_morphospace_regimes`, L418-444), and 8-point polyp pumping sweep (`evaluate_pump_amplitude_sweep`, L451-497), backed by 3 machine-checked Lean 4 theorems in `morphoeval/lean/loops/Loop_100_hydractinia_stolon_vascular_net.lean`." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-model-fidelity> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/model-fidelity" ;
    pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-badin-hydractinia-stolon-vascular-net-model-fidelity-1>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-badin-hydractinia-stolon-vascular-net-model-fidelity-2>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-badin-hydractinia-stolon-vascular-net-model-fidelity-3> ;
    pk:hasScore 9.5e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-badin-hydractinia-stolon-vascular-net-morphometric-validation> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Buss, Anderson & Perry (2015) Biol. Bull., Dudgeon et al. (1999) Am. Nat. & Blackstone (1999) Syst. Biol. colonial hydroid pulsatile gastrovascular stolon network, anastomosis loop closure, and runner-to-sheet morphospace — Morphometric validation: 94/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "`measure_morphoeval()` (L807-904) computes 9 reference-anchored morphometric measurements with uncertainty, Pearson p-values, RMSE, and negative controls: Podocoryna runner alpha = 0.1064 (ref 0.0850), 2,4-DNP uncoupled shift alpha = 0.3404 (ref 0.3650, delta +0.2340), Hydractinia mature sheet alpha = 0.7872 (ref 0.7900, arrest ablation delta +0.7872), runner-to-sheet meshedness sweep Pearson r = 0.99886 (RMSE = 0.0130, p = 3.74e-9), coenosarc mat coverage sweep Pearson r = 0.99768 (RMSE = 0.0213, p = 3.12e-8), MgCl2 arrest surviving stolon fraction = 0.0000 (ref 0.0000), specimen coenosarc coverage = 0.8918 (ref 0.8918), specimen planar meshedness alpha = 0.7800 (ref 0.7800, b_1 = 514 loops), and specimen inter-polyp NND CV = 0.3022 (18.64 +- 5.63 px)." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-morphometric-validation> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/morphometric-validation" ;
    pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-badin-hydractinia-stolon-vascular-net-measurement-2-4-dnp-redox-uncoupled-podocoryna-shift-eta-0-90-planar-meshedness-alpha>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-badin-hydractinia-stolon-vascular-net-measurement-hydractinia-mature-stolonal-sheet-eta-1-65-planar-meshedness-alpha>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-badin-hydractinia-stolon-vascular-net-measurement-hydractinia-symbiolongicarpus-specimen-coenosarc-mat-tissue-coverage>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-badin-hydractinia-stolon-vascular-net-measurement-hydractinia-symbiolongicarpus-specimen-inter-polyp-spacing-cv>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-badin-hydractinia-stolon-vascular-net-measurement-hydractinia-symbiolongicarpus-specimen-planar-meshedness-alpha>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-badin-hydractinia-stolon-vascular-net-measurement-podocoryna-runner-regime-eta-0-55-planar-meshedness-alpha>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-badin-hydractinia-stolon-vascular-net-measurement-polyp-excision-mgcl2-contraction-arrest-surviving-stolon-fraction>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-badin-hydractinia-stolon-vascular-net-measurement-runner-to-sheet-coenosarc-stolonal-mat-area-coverage-correlation>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-badin-hydractinia-stolon-vascular-net-measurement-runner-to-sheet-polyp-pumping-sweep-planar-meshedness-correlation>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-badin-hydractinia-stolon-vascular-net-morphometric-validation-1> ;
    pk:hasScore 9.4e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .

